:"யாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"யாங்கு","lemma":"யாங்கு","gloss":"how"}],"gloss":"how"},{"surface":"ஆகுவள்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"future tense marker"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"அள்","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she will become"},{"surface":"கொல்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"surface":"தானே","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"she"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis marker"}],"gloss":"she herself"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருமுது","parts":[{"text":"பெரு","lemma":"பெரு","gloss":"great"},{"text":"முது","lemma":"முது","gloss":"ancient"}],"gloss":"greatly ancient"},{"surface":"செல்வர்","parts":[{"text":"செல்வர்","lemma":"செல்வர்","gloss":"wealthy people"}],"gloss":"of the wealthy people"},{"surface":"ஒருமட","parts":[{"text":"ஒருமட","lemma":"ஒருமட","gloss":"singularly innocent"}],"gloss":"singularly innocent","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மகளே","parts":[{"text":"மகள்","lemma":"மகள்","gloss":"daughter"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"address/emphasis"}],"gloss":"O daughter!"}]}],"literal":"Breasts indeed have budded / The thick soft hair-locks have hung downwards / The closely aligned white teeth have fully grown in place of the fallen ones / And a few beauty spots have appeared / That she is tormenting (me), I indeed know, but she does not know / How will she become, indeed / The unique innocent daughter of the very wealthy elders?","translation":"Her breasts have begun to bud. Her thick, soft hair-locks now hang down. Her close-set white teeth have fully replaced her baby teeth. A few golden beauty spots have also appeared on her skin. I know only too well that she has the power to torment me, but she herself is unaware of it. What will become of her, this singularly innocent daughter of the ancient, wealthy elders?","modern":"அவளுடைய மார்பகங்கள் அரும்பத் தொடங்கிவிட்டன. அடர்ந்த மென்மையான கூந்தல் கீழ்நோக்கித் தொங்குகிறது. விழுந்த பற்களுக்குப் பதிலாக நெருக்கமான வரிசையுடைய வெண் பற்கள் முளைத்து நிறைந்துவிட்டன. உடம்பில் சில தேமல்களும் தோன்றியுள்ளன. அவள் என்னை வருத்துவதை நான் அறிவேன், ஆனால் அவளோ அதை அறியாதவளாக இருக்கிறாள். பெரும் செல்வம் படைத்த முதியோரின் ஒப்பற்ற இளமகள் இனி என்னவாகப் போகிறாளோ?","explanation":"This poem is set in the Kurinji (mountainous) landscape and is spoken by the hero (Thalaivan) to himself. He observes the physical transition of the heroine from childhood to youth, noting her budding breasts, long hair, fully grown adult teeth, and the appearance of golden beauty spots (sunangu). He realizes that her emerging beauty has the power to torment him with love-longing, yet she remains completely innocent and unaware of her own charm. He wonders with concern and affection about what lies ahead for this precious, sheltered daughter of a wealthy family. The imagery of physical maturation beautifully captures the threshold of love and the hero's deep infatuation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.5],[1.6,1.7],[1.8,2.04],[2.1,2.17],[2.3,3.6],[3.6,4.0],[4.0,4.0],[4.0,4.31],[4.31,4.62],[4.62,5.25],[5.25,5.56],[5.56,6.88],[7.07,8.2],[8.2,8.77],[8.77,9.13],[9.25,9.94],[11.32,12.36],[12.89,12.95],[12.95,13.01],[13.01,13.01],[13.01,13.14],[13.14,13.2],[13.2,13.5],[13.5,14.5],[14.5,14.5],[14.5,15.2],[15.2,15.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.43],[1.55,1.68],[1.8,2.2],[2.3,2.33],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.3],[3.3,3.3],[3.3,3.3],[3.3,3.3],[3.3,3.3],[3.3,8.0],[8.0,8.5],[8.5,9.84],[9.84,10.1],[10.16,12.53],[12.53,12.56],[12.57,12.6],[12.6,12.95],[12.95,12.95],[12.95,14.0],[14.0,14.77],[15.06,15.2],[15.2,16.4],[16.4,16.4],[16.4,17.4],[17.4,17.8]]},"sync":[[["முலையே","breasts indeed"]],[["முகிழ்முகிழ்த்தனவே","have budded indeed"]],[["முகிழ்முகிழ்த்தனவே","have budded indeed"]],[["தலையே","hair indeed"]],[["கிளைஇய","thick/branched out"]],[["மென்குரல்","soft hair-locks"]],[["கிழக்கு","downwards"]],[["வீழ்ந்தனவே","have hung down indeed"]],[["வீழ்ந்தனவே","have hung down indeed"]],[["செறிநிரை","closely aligned rows"]],[["வெண்பலும்","and the white teeth"]],[["பறிமுறை","the order of falling out"]],[["நிரம்பின","are fully grown"]],[["சுணங்கும்","and the beauty spots"]],[["சில","a few"],["தோன்றினவே","have appeared indeed"]],[["தோன்றினவே","have appeared indeed"]],[["அணங்குதற்","tormenting"]],[["கியான்றன்","for me indeed"]],[["கியான்றன்","for me indeed"],["அறிவலே","I know indeed"]],[["தான்","she"],["அறியலளே","knows not indeed"]],[["அறியலளே","knows not indeed"]],[["யாங்கு","how"]],[["ஆகுவள்","she will become"],["கொல்","particle of doubt"]],[["தானே","she herself"]],[["பெருமுது","greatly ancient"]],[["செல்வர்","of the wealthy people"]],[["செல்வர்","of the wealthy people"],["ஒருமட","singularly innocent"]],[["மகளே","O daughter!"]]]}